<header id="intro" class="w-100 bg-blush-pink">
  <div class="hero-panel w-100 w-50-l bg-white-l flex justify-center">
    <div class="hero-intro">
      <p class="hero-copy f5 lh-copy normal">I'm a designer based in Lausanne. I help teams build digital systems for their users. I do the whole research – prototyping – testing loop, and I take care of the minute implementations details in production code.</p>
      <p class="hero-copy f5 lh-copy normal">After two startups and independant practice I'm increasingly interested in the business side of products and companies.</p>
      <div class="hero-status">
        <p class="f6 normal">Open for work</p>
        <a href="downloads/CV Gaël Paccard_EN.pdf" class="cta f6 normal">Download my CV</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div id="recentProjects" class="bg-projects-grey flex justify-center">
  <div class="w-100 mw7 ph2 pv6">
    <div class="project-row">
      <h3 class="f6 b">Recent projects</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="project-row">
      <h3 class="f4 normal">Popt Notes</h3>
      <p class="f6 normal">iOS app offering intelligent yet private note taking</p>
      <a class="f6 normal" href="https://apps.apple.com/ch/app/popt-notes/id6505097998?l=en-GB">App store</a>
    </div>
    <div class="project-row">
      <h3 class="f4 normal">Time Atlas</h3>
      <p class="f6 normal">Historical-geographical platform for the digital humanity community</p>
      <a class="f6 normal" href="https://timeatlas.eu/about">Website</a>
    </div>
    <div class="project-row">
      <h3 class="f4 normal">CarbonViz</h3>
      <p class="f6 normal">Browser extension that quantifies the impact of your web usage</p>
      <a class="f6 normal" href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/carbonviz/lieikallcilhkihohkajnhmhkiipaaaf">Chrome</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

